doc: A busy repo shows every panel it has data for, and each panel's letter jumps to it
given busy
when keys s
then panel = status
then overview = Sync=↑2 ↓1 vs origin/feat/login Files=1 staged · 3 unstaged Peers=— Stashes=4 Notes=doing.md: wip Template=v0.9.1 → v0.10.0 PRs=#42 Add login flow CI=—
when keys b
then panel = branches
when keys p
then panel = prs
when keys e
then panel = peers
when keys t
then panel = stashes
when keys n
then panel = notes
